WEBVTT

00:03:57.316 --> 00:04:01.279
"Who or what has been most
instrumental to your success?"

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.865
The results and the response
have been startling.

00:04:05.241 --> 00:04:07.868
DP: The system was not created
for women of color.

00:04:08.494 --> 00:04:10.997
It doesn't show up
in the same ways for us.

00:04:12.123 --> 00:04:17.086
And we all need to let go of the idea
that it's a meritocracy.

00:04:17.461 --> 00:04:20.214
People everywhere are talking
about being burnt out.

00:04:20.548 --> 00:04:23.342
But women of color,
we're not just burnt out.

00:04:23.342 --> 00:04:24.802
We're traumatized.

00:04:25.386 --> 00:04:27.430
The weight of microaggressions,

00:04:27.471 --> 00:04:29.640
racism and hatred at work,

00:04:29.682 --> 00:04:31.600
it takes a toll on us.